# Cerberus system user for the vsock-watch detective control. A DIFFERENT
# account than cerberus-api's "cerberus" user — see
# docs/vsock-connect-detection.md §4.3: a compromise of the cerberus account
# alone must not also blind this watcher. dh_installsysusers installs this to
# /usr/lib/sysusers.d/cerberus-vsock-watch.conf and invokes systemd-sysusers
# from the postinst.
#Type Name           ID GECOS                             Home          Shell
u     cerberus-audit -  "Cerberus VSOCK-watch detective control" /etc/cerberus /usr/sbin/nologin
